{"overview":"گروهی از کارگران محلی کنترل حیوانات زندگی‌شان به این دلیل پیچیده می‌شود که حیوانات ساده‌اند اما انسان‌ها نه؛ رهبر تیم فرانک، افسر کنترل حیوانات سرسخت و عجیب‌وغریب است که شاید دانشگاه نرفته باشد اما همچنان پرمطالعه‌ترین فرد در جمع است؛ در گذشته به عنوان پلیس سعی کرد فساد در بخش خود را فاش کند اما به دلیل این کار اخراج شد و اکنون بدبین و خشنود است؛ با این حال، او توانایی تقریباً فوق‌العاده‌ای برای درک حیوانات دارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A group of local animal control workers' lives are complicated by the fact that animals are simple, but humans are not. Leading the crew is Frank, an opinionated, eccentric animal control officer who may not have gone to college but is still the most well-read person in the room. In his past life as a cop, Frank tried to expose corruption in his department, but his efforts got him fired, leaving him cynical and curmudgeonly. Despite his rough exterior, he is blessed with an almost superhuman ability to understand animals.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2023,"poster":"/6repc8cYh3oDXm8rW6nWSyNeqb5.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":9,"y":2024,"poster":"/7egthrLQ8U9fzgutji0UlyRNKZF.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2025,"poster":"/el5G53QWQwjxYoThm7aQqPpQ4u0.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":12,"y":2025,"poster":"/h2dXm0CXMkycA9LrZbXMUD8SuTL.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":4,"y":2026,"poster":"/shMeXvl5JmQSjTVDEVuUpLPWrnJ.jpg"}],"episodes":47,"crew":["Bob Fisher","Rob Greenberg","Dan Sterling"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"جول مک‌هال","role":"Frank Shaw","photo":"/7iwIiaYhIPaiAyiaZOc2Gl1ZAY4.jpg","en":"Joel McHale"},{"name":"Vella Lovell","role":"Emily Price","photo":"/parPBtWN9ooQ8E2s31rm7XiYda4.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Rowland","role":"Fred 'Shred' Taylor","photo":"/zdb3GhmJ9GsY1MueEq4HQfYCF6R.jpg"},{"name":"Ravi Patel","role":"Amit Patel","photo":"/94GutLAPx72fqxe6XUQ3HWxANxz.jpg"},{"name":"Grace Palmer","role":"Victoria 